# Live environment values stay local. Only a reviewed example is publishable.
/.env*
!/.env.example

# Classify SPEC.md and additional logs/captures/data by purpose before upload.
# Preserve README/user/architecture/protocol guides, LICENSE/NOTICE, meaningful
# tests/fixtures source and required runtime assets. Do not ignore all *.md,
# docs/, tests/ or build/. Merge compiler intermediates separately.

/docs/verification/
/build/simple_programming_tool.ini
